 row operation to ${E}_{1}A,$ we multiply by ${E}_{2}$ on the left and get ${E}_{2}{E}_{1}A:$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot A\n$$\n\nFinally, to apply the third elementary row operation to ${E}_{2}{E}_{1}A,$ we multiply by ${E}_{3}$ on the left and get ${E}_{3}{E}_{2}{E}_{1}A:$ \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot A\n$$" 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342737 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342738 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342739 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342740 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342741 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1041 "selection" 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342740 13194139535301 true] [17592186342736 1110 #uuid "d069d958-32e1-5738-8d57-ceb01abe88a6" 13194139535301 true] [17592186342737 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot A" 13194139535301 true] [17592186342737 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535301 true] [17592186342737 1111 #uuid "1d288367-87ac-5577-bbfa-c3d34f5e2527" 13194139535301 true] [17592186342738 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot A" 13194139535301 true]